 (13,'DISC-001','Re-source ACS tutorials ORG-009/010','discovery','done','P3',NULL,NULL,NULL,'research/strategy/sources.yaml; research/source-registry.md',NULL,'Wayback failed; GF-003 suffices. Non-blocking. Closed 17 Sep 2026 by CDX enumeration + exact-URL replay (the 15 Sep failure was URL keying, not availability: the Wayback key includes the captured query string, so dropping ?s=<token> returns a 404 that reads as not archived). ORG-009 RECOVERED: Thread/618 (capture 2023-02-06, 37 KB) and Thread/790 (capture 2022-10-04, 83 KB) both replay with full ACS text - union attack flow, five-player cap, ACS defend deploy - an independent confirmation of the GF-003-sourced ACS-001..012 claims, so no re-mining. ORG-010 (Thread/621 colonisation) has NO capture at all and its domain is already sourced by TP-016/WIK-012/PLW-002, so it closes as unrecoverable. Registry + sources.yaml updated.','2026-09-17 12:37:03'),
