 (57,'LLM-008','S4b — the remaining four campaign consultation triggers (fleet loss, rank change, repeated setback, coalition conflict)','impl','done','P2',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'NewPhase + ContestedObjective are wired. These four need signals that do not exist yet: fleet loss needs side-loss detection on BattleReport, rank change needs per-campaign rank semantics over AiScoreSample, repeated setback needs a failed-battle counter, coalition conflict needs faction membership in the battle observer.','2026-09-16 21:46:58'),
 (58,'LLM-009','S8 — read-only tool set replacing prompt-stuffing (campaign consultation first)','impl','done','P2',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'Build CampaignFactsTool, LegalCandidatesTool, CounterpartyFactsTool, HostCapabilityTool (Laravel\AI\Contracts\Tool); the consultation agent implements HasTools; base prompt shrinks to instructions + current turn; tools are host-read, bounded, read-only, never an authority. Studied in plan/details/research/laravel-ai-tools.md. DeepSeek + OpenAI support tool calls.','2026-09-16 21:55:07'),
