 (76,'WP-017','Liveness floor under next-due time','impl','done','P2',NULL,NULL,NULL,'plan/details/research/repos/WORK-PACKAGE.md','app/Domain/Scheduling/SessionDecisionService.php; app/Domain/Routine/SessionPlanner.php; config/population.php','Clamp nextDueAt to a configurable max idleness so a long persona-shaped absence cannot trip host inactivity cleanup; keyed off explicit AiProfile identity. Confirm the host purge threshold first or this is YAGNI. Source: ogame-opensource-2-ai.','2026-09-17 14:04:35'),
 (77,'WP-018','Rare no-op idle override + anti-bot threshold self-check','impl','done','P2',NULL,NULL,NULL,'plan/details/research/repos/WORK-PACKAGE.md','app/Domain/Decision/DecisionEngine.php','After scoring, a small seeded, skill-band-aware draw selects DoNothing even when real actions exist (never when fleetsaveEligible/reactionWakeAt set); plus a regression test asserting departures stay under the host anti-bot thresholds. Source: hammermaps-ogamex-ai-players.','2026-09-17 14:10:49'),
