 (83,'DISC-008','Synthesize LLM-usage research into adoptable work items','discovery','done','P2',NULL,NULL,NULL,'plan/details/research/repos/llm-ogame-ai.md; plan/details/specs/llm-full-utilisation.md (S9)','plan/details/research/repos/llm-ogame-ai.md','Distill prompting / context-management / model-choice / cost-control ideas into WP tasks. Only 3 repos genuinely call an LLM (ogame-agi Gemini, DotAgent kimi/llama-3.1, OGame Commander Qwen2.5-VL-72B); all route through OpenAI-compatible endpoints at cheap models, force a closed JSON action vocabulary, feed summarized snapshots (never raw DOM) and fall back to deterministic code on any error. Closed 17 Sep 2026: scored the 16 learnings against shipped S1-S8. 15 already shipped/gated/refused (self-reflection and rolling summaries refused by doctrine: budgets.md forbids periodic reflection and per-event summaries, and the six deterministic trigger signals already carry what materially changed). One real gap found inside a shipped slice, recorded as LLM-010: the SDK exposes cacheReadInputTokens and both parsers subtract it from promptTokens, but the gateway reads promptTokens/completionTokens only and settlement passes a hardcoded 0 into the parameter ResolveAiUsageCostAction already prices, so cached input is uncounted, uncharged and unreported. Synthesis written to plan/details/specs/llm-full-utilisation.md S9 (with the scored-learnings table). No code changed.','2026-09-17 12:25:16'),
 (84,'DISC-009','Synthesize PvE research into adoptable work items','discovery','done','P2',NULL,NULL,NULL,'plan/details/research/repos/pve-concepts.md; plan/details/specs/pve-empire.md','plan/details/research/repos/pve-concepts.md','Distill transferable PvE ideas into the PvE empire spec: AI faction racing the same objective (Travian Natars), phased escalation ladder (EVE Triglavian), influence bar gating the climax + completion-gated rewards (EVE Incursions), succession state machine (Stellaris Marauders/Horde), outcome-scaled difficulty (Stellaris Crises). Closed 17 Sep 2026: scored the 12 transferable structures in pve-concepts.md against pve-empire.md and the Package 7 evidence rule. Adopted: the faction races the same objective via one counter on AiCampaign plus its own declared objective set (ideas 1+2+3 folded into one mechanism; objective order is the ladder, the counter is the influence bar) = PVE-001, deferred to a campaign review record. Deferred with a trigger: the coalition-facing campaign page (progress + both sides losses as write-time counters) = PVE-002, waits on a disclosed coalition. No slice needed for contribution rewards, the published window or per-stronghold difficulty (a stronghold is an ordinary account; a difficulty field would be a second authority over the profile). Refused on gate 2/3: titles/achievements, a near-faction scaling penalty, a damage treadmill. Synthesis written to plan/details/specs/pve-empire.md. No code changed.','2026-09-17 12:25:16'),
