 (159,'DEF-013','Relationship stance modulates reply wording','impl','done','P3',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'app/Actions/BuildAuthoredSocialReplyAction.php','see plan/details/specs/relational-memory.md','2026-09-20 08:31:17'),
 (160,'DEF-014','Forgiveness requires earned trust, not apologetic warmth','impl','done','P1',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'app/Domain/Conversation/NativeSocialCognition.php','closes the apology-spam exploit; see plan/details/specs/relational-memory.md','2026-09-20 08:22:25'),
 (161,'DEF-015','Atomic observation writes (fix building-queue duplicate race)','impl','done','P1',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'app/Models/AiObservation.php','locking re-read on unique violation; fixes host building-item skip','2026-09-20 08:46:42'),
 (162,'DEF-016','Compensation delivery observed and settles the promise (live trust repair)','impl','done','P1',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'Wires DEF-012 into production: ObserveCommittedFleetMessage -> RecordObservedTransferAction -> FulfillAiCommitmentAction; classifier recognises CompensationOffer; 48h default deadline.','2026-09-20 13:14:46'),
 (163,'DEF-017','Alliance ecosystem: feeder alliances instead of permanent exile','impl','done','P1','G18',NULL,'SOC2',NULL,'app/Actions/AdvanceAiAllianceLifeAction.php; app/Domain/Social/AllianceChoice.php; app/Actions/ReviewAiAllianceApplicationsAction.php','Shipped membership is broken: found-first-only + permanent rejection exiles the bottom half (grand: 5 of 20 AI accounts rejected, locked out forever). Two levers: (a) a leader whose alliance would reject a qualified applicant founds a feeder alliance instead of exiling them; (b) a rejected applicant may re-apply after a cooldown. Proof: seeded universe organises into >=2 alliances and no enabled account is permanently unallied. Gates: 3 (a player joins a different alliance when one refuses them); 1 (tiers from host rank data only); 2 (one rule, no new mechanism). Spec: plan/details/specs/alliance-social-completion.md','2026-09-21 11:06:09'),
 (164,'DEF-018','Speak first: sourced contextual social initiation','impl','done','P2','G12,S4',NULL,'SOC1',NULL,'app/Actions/InitiateAiSocialContactAction.php','The four named initiations (SOC1): report-share after a raid, thank-you after a received transport, greeting a neighbour who probed us, alliance application. Each fires only on its trigger, at human latency, authored text (never templated); unrecognised state initiates nothing. Proof: each trigger produces exactly one delivered message; no trigger produces none. Gates: 3 (a player reaches out after something happened); 1 (recipient and trigger from host/module data, no list); 2 (one action, four sourced triggers). Spec: gameplay-algorithms.md SOC1.','2026-09-21 11:15:29'),
 (165,'DEF-019','Answer alliance invitations and notes','impl','done','P3','S3',NULL,'SOC3',NULL,'app/Actions/ReviewAiInvitationsAction.php','DECIDED, nothing to build (SOC3 rule: decide per surface, handle only the decided ones). Buildable surfaces already shipped: alliance application (DEF-006), buddy request from a contact (DEF-009). The rest are decisions: a note is private and needs no answer; the merchant has no offers; there is no marketplace or alliance-invitation host surface (X2 closed). FleetUnionInvite (ACS combat coordination) is a separate deferral (DEF-010 sibling), not SOC3.','2026-09-21 11:16:22'),
 (166,'DEF-020','Verification scenario suite (one replay per authenticity signal)','impl','done','P1',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'resources/scenarios/*.json; app/Actions/ReplayAiScenarioAction.php; tests/Feature/ScenarioReplayTest.php','Eight shipped replay scenarios pin the decision-engine signals (miner-under-visible-raid, late-notice-doomed-save, routine-21-days, economy-chain, throttle-mine-when-short, colonize-needs-development, divergence-two-accounts, spy-two-accounts), each asserted in tests/Feature/ScenarioReplayTest.php under a frozen clock + seed. The non-decision-engine signals (social breadth, message content, activity marker, transfers) verify via their named feature tests, not replay. Spec: verification-and-monitoring.md section 1 (matrix updated).','2026-09-21 11:55:17'),
 (167,'DEF-021','Provocation harness: a scripted adversarial neighbour','impl','done','P2',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'scripts/provoke-ai.php; tests/Feature/ProvocationHarnessTest.php','A scripted neighbour probes/attacks/apologizes/offers+delivers compensation and records reaction latency, save success+failure, forgiveness refusal, trust repair and thank-you, plus a 24h sleep window. Runs on a capacity universe, writes a machine-parsable report. Spec: verification-and-monitoring.md section 2.','2026-09-21 12:01:19'),
 (168,'DEF-022','Aggregate measurement: social entropy and reaction window','impl','done','P2',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'app/Domain/Operability/AiAuthenticityOverview.php; app/Actions/BuildAiAuthenticityPanelAction.php','Measure Shannon entropy over interaction types (vs 0.84 human baseline), reaction-window distribution, and wake-time spread; feed the review loop''s five questions. Spec: verification-and-monitoring.md section 1/3.','2026-09-21 12:07:53'),
 (169,'DEF-024','Situation dashboard: the five review questions rendered','impl','done','P2',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'app/Actions/BuildAiSituationPanelAction.php; app/Domain/Operability/AiSituationOverview.php; resources/views/index.blade.php','Render the review loop''s five questions (capability-chain stage, growth explicability, divergence, reaction/save shape, server aliveness) with figures + evidence class. Budget spend line already shipped (DEF-023). Spec: verification-and-monitoring.md section 5.','2026-09-21 12:13:25'),
 (170,'DEF-025','PvE cooperation + generative-lane conformance runs','impl','done','P3',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'scripts/e2e-pve-cooperation.php; plan/details/reviews/','Verify alliance cooperation, campaign consultation (advice lane), language chat, and the cooperative hostility policy on pve; run ai:cognition-conformance + ai:language-conformance sanitized; record a dated review. Spec: verification-and-monitoring.md section 3.','2026-09-21 12:20:12'),
 (171,'DEF-023','Monthly cost wall ($10) for the generative lanes','impl','done','P1',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'app/Actions/ReserveAiUsageAction.php; config/cognition.php; app/Actions/SummarizeAiProviderVisibilityAction.php; app/Domain/Operability/AiProviderVisibilityOverview.php; resources/views/index.blade.php; tests/Feature/AiUsageReservationTest.php','A hard monthly spend ceiling (AI_MONTHLY_COST_USD, default 10) read by ReserveAiUsageAction against the month''s settled cost; the provider panel shows month-to-date spend against the wall. Proof: AiUsageReservationTest (3 new tests).','2026-09-21 11:42:44'),
 (172,'DEF-026','Social loop forms durable friends (alliance bond) and enemies (shared attacker)','impl','done','P1',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'app/Actions/RecordObservedAllianceMembershipStartAction.php; app/Actions/RecordObservedBattleReportAction.php; tests/Feature/CommittedChatObservationTest.php; tests/Feature/AllyUnderAttackObservationTest.php','Live read found the trust/threat graph flat (avg trust 0.00, 0 friends/0 enemies) despite 136 AI-vs-AI battles and 2-3 alliances: only delivered compensation moved trust, and battles only moved threat on a defender loss. Two bloc mechanics: (a) alliance membership bonds the joiner and each co-member (trust +0.15, affinity +0.20 both ways); (b) an ally under attack marks the attacker (threat +0.20, trust -0.05) and warms the ally (affinity +0.10). Gates: 3 (a player trusts their alliance and marks a shared attacker); 1 (no lists); 2 (two small additions to existing actions).','2026-09-21 13:38:42'),
 (173,'DEF-027','AI-to-AI chat uses the LLM and speaks like a real player','impl','done','P1',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'app/Actions/GenerateAiReplyAction.php; app/Ai/Agents/OgameConversationReplyAgent.php; tests/Feature/LaravelAiLanguageTest.php; tests/Feature/ConversationEscalationTest.php','Live read: every AI-to-AI reply was authored text ("I cannot cooperate under the current relationship", "Hello.") because GenerateAiReplyAction refused a counterparty that is itself an AI. Removed the guard so substantive exchanges reach the language lane, and rewrote the reply agent instructions to demand natural OGame speech (short, casual, shorthand, persona-matched). Authored text stays the provider-off/budget/failure fallback; daily limits + the $10 wall bound spend. Gates: 3 (a player types like a player); 1 (no object lists in the prompt); 2 (one guard removed, one prompt rewritten).','2026-09-21 16:08:00'),
 (174,'DEF-028','Persona taste: continuous seeded dimensions (diligence, aggression, sociability)','impl','done','P1',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'app/Domain/Persona/PersonaTaste.php; app/Domain/Decision/QueueableFleetSavePlanner.php; tests/Feature/PersonaTasteTest.php; tests/Feature/ProactiveSaveTest.php','Every account is a different player, not the same persona N times. PersonaTaste derives three seeded continuous dimensions (diligence, aggression, sociability). Aggression is wired into the fleetsave exposure band (proactive only, reactive save untouched); diligence and sociability are derived but unwired — both wirings (sessionsPerDay, response turns) were reverted because the cadence and conversation-loop tests are calibrated (follow-ups in the spec). Gates: 3 (some risk more); 1 (no object lists); 2 (one value object + one call site). Spec: plan/details/specs/persona-taste.md.','2026-09-21 17:10:17'),
 (175,'DEF-029','Wire diligence into session cadence and sociability into initiation','impl','done','P1',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'app/Domain/Routine/RoutineProfile.php; app/Actions/InitiateAiSocialContactAction.php; tests/Feature/PersonaTasteTest.php; tests/Feature/RoutineCadenceTest.php','DEF-028 shipped only aggression. This closes the two remaining dimensions: diligence -> sessionsPerDay (band-bounded inside each archetype presence band) and sociability -> per-session initiation cap. Also fixes the dark-period test''s last-partial-day artifact that blocked the first diligence attempt. Gates: 3 (some play more, some reach out more); 1 (no object lists); 2 (two small call sites). Spec: plan/details/specs/persona-taste.md.','2026-09-21 17:45:53'),
 (176,'DEF-030','A member welcomes a newly-joined alliance member','impl','done','P1',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'app/Actions/InitiateAiSocialContactAction.php; tests/Feature/SocialInitiationTest.php','The live hour read found the social loop dead: grand had 0 exchanges in 60 minutes because nothing consumes the AllianceMembershipJoined observation. The leader''s application-accept welcome (DEF-007) is a different path, so an ordinary member never greets a newcomer. This adds a proactive welcome in InitiateAiSocialContactAction, gated by sociability (>=0.5), so a chatty member says hello and a quiet one stays silent. Gates: 3 (a member greets a new ally); 1 (no lists); 2 (one method + one loop, reuses the authored pipeline).','2026-09-21 20:01:01'),
 (177,'UX-001','AiSettings YAML schema + symfony/yaml parse + boot validation + back-compat shim','impl','done','P1',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'app/Support/AiSettings.php','One ai-settings.yaml file, one typed schema; every config file becomes a reader. Test: bad YAML fails with key+line; on/off quoted; missing key uses default.','2026-09-21 22:08:34'),
