 (201,'PERS-001','Persona decomposition — add activity_band, defense_doctrine, stockpile_strategy, economic_role + persona_version (schema only)','impl','todo','P2',NULL,NULL,NULL,'specs/persona-decomposition.md','database/migrations/*_decompose_ai_profile.php; app/Enums/AiActivityBand.php; app/Enums/AiDefenseDoctrine.php; app/Enums/AiStockpileStrategy.php; app/Enums/AiEconomicRole.php; app/Models/AiProfile.php','Schema + four enums + persona_version=1. Migration backfills existing rows deterministically from their current archetype; no planner behaviour changes. Never silently reinterpret persisted enum values (Trader=4, Casual=5 are migration-only). Gate 1: enums are module policy, no object ids. Gate 2: one migration, four enums, one cast update.','2026-09-30 19:18:55'),
 (202,'PERS-002','AiPersonaFactory — conditional field distributions + weighted character-class selection','impl','todo','P1',NULL,NULL,NULL,'specs/persona-decomposition.md','app/Domain/Persona/AiPersonaFactory.php; app/Actions/SeedAiTestUniverseAction.php','Generate archetype -> defense_doctrine/stockpile_strategy/economic_role/activity_band from conditional distributions, with skill shifting the same distribution; weighted character-class selection (archetype, skill, seed), stable once selected. persona_version pins the distribution so seed-derived identity survives distribution edits. Gate 2: one factory, one distribution table.','2026-09-24 12:47:32'),
 (203,'PERS-003','Presence band keyed by activity_band, not archetype','impl','todo','P2',NULL,NULL,NULL,'specs/persona-decomposition.md; specs/persona-taste.md','app/Domain/Routine/RoutineProfile.php','presenceBand(AiActivityBand): Casual 1-3, Regular 3-7, Active 7-12, Hardcore 12-18. sessionsPerDay = min + round((max-min)*diligence) stays. A casual fleeter and a hardcore miner become possible; diligence still places the account inside its band.','2026-09-24 12:47:32'),
 (204,'PERS-004','DefenseNeedEvaluator — defence need from exposure, not an archetype ratio','impl','in_progress','P1',NULL,NULL,'U3','specs/persona-decomposition.md; specs/decision-doctrine.md (D7)','app/Domain/Decision/QueueableUnitPlanner.php (needsStandingDefense/standingDefenseFloor); app/Domain/Decision/DefenseNeedEvaluator.php; app/Domain/Decision/DefenseNeed.php','Replace standingDefenseFloor(AiArchetype) with DefenseNeedEvaluator -> DefenseNeed(protectedValue, currentDefenseValue, ThreatBand, DefenseIntent), from offline production, stored resources, stationary fleet/sat value, activity/offline duration, defense_doctrine, skill, known local threat, incoming attack. Replaces the helper, does not sit beside it.','2026-09-28 20:29:03'),
 (205,'PERS-005','DefenseCompositionPlanner — build to a doctrine''s target wall, not max attack/cost','impl','in_progress','P1',NULL,NULL,'U3','specs/persona-decomposition.md; specs/decision-doctrine.md (D7)','app/Domain/Decision/QueueableUnitPlanner.php (bestDefense); app/Domain/Decision/DefenseCompositionPlanner.php','Split composition from need: a doctrine targets a wall composition (fodder/rocket-plasma/balanced/heavy/bunker/adaptive); build the component most below its target ratio, queue within the session. Two veteran miners with different doctrines genuinely disagree. Reads defence objects from ObjectService::getDefenseObjects() (gate 1).','2026-09-28 20:11:46'),
 (206,'PERS-006','ThreatResponsePlanner — an inbound produces response intents, not one random turret','impl','todo','P2',NULL,NULL,NULL,'specs/persona-decomposition.md; specs/decision-doctrine.md (D6,D7)','app/Domain/Decision/QueueableUnitPlanner.php (underAttack path); app/Domain/Decision/ThreatResponsePlanner.php','underAttack() today builds one high attack/cost turret on the first eligible planet. An inbound should produce intents (evacuateFleet, evacuateResources, reinforceDefense, attemptNinja, DoNothing), possibly several at once, fulfilled by existing planners. Eliminates the first-eligible-planet-gets-one-unit shape.','2026-09-24 12:47:32'),
 (207,'PERS-007','SavingsGoal — intentional saving for a named goal (stockpile-strategy wiring)','impl','todo','P1',NULL,NULL,'E6,E7','specs/persona-decomposition.md; specs/decision-doctrine.md (D10)','app/Domain/Decision/EconomyUpgrades.php; app/Domain/Decision/QueueableBuildingPlanner.php; app/Domain/Persona/SavingsGoal.php','Can-I-afford -> buy is a hoarder, not a player. A GoalSaver reserves for Astrophysics/Plasma/fleet batch/defence package/colony: spendable = available - reserved. stockpile_strategy decides how, never whether D10 spend-first binds the ImmediateSpender. Fixes the 2B-metal pathology at the cause, not with defence.','2026-09-24 12:47:32'),
 (208,'PERS-008','Archetype cleanup — add Raider + Hybrid, migrate Trader -> economic role and Casual -> activity band','impl','deferred','P2',NULL,NULL,NULL,'specs/persona-decomposition.md','app/Enums/AiArchetype.php; app/Actions/SeedAiTestUniverseAction.php; app/Domain/Routine/RoutineProfile.php; app/Domain/Cognition/NativeAffectEngine.php; app/Domain/Decision/Policies/*; every match(AiArchetype) call site','AiArchetype means only how the account primarily expects to grow: Miner/Turtle/Raider/Fleeter/Hybrid. Retain Trader=4/Casual=5 as migration-only or migrate explicitly - never renumber. No Expeditioner until expedition behaviour lands. Update characterClass, standingDefenseFloor, vengeance, presenceBand and the policies. Behaviours moved off archetype first (PERS-003..007). | FROZEN 1 Oct 2026 (direction reset, AGENTS.md): no work until the six aspects of play move live on the cohorts. Unfreeze by setting status back to todo.','2026-10-01 10:03:35'),
 (209,'PERS-009','Skill band controls reasoning sophistication, not just decision noise','impl','deferred','P2',NULL,NULL,NULL,'specs/persona-decomposition.md; specs/persona-taste.md','app/Domain/Decision/QueueableUnitPlanner.php; app/Domain/Decision/RaidPlanner.php; app/Domain/Decision/QueueableFleetSavePlanner.php; app/Domain/Decision/EconomyUpgrades.php','Today Novice vs Veteran only differs in score noise; a veteran turtle and novice turtle build identical defence. One match(skill) per planner: novice fixed package / standard profitability-aware / veteran local-threat simulation across defence, raids, fleetsave, economy. | FROZEN 1 Oct 2026 (direction reset, AGENTS.md): no work until the six aspects of play move live on the cohorts. Unfreeze by setting status back to todo.','2026-10-01 10:03:35'),
 (210,'PERS-010','Soften personality forbids — allows() means legality, preference replaces prohibition','impl','deferred','P2',NULL,NULL,NULL,'specs/persona-decomposition.md','app/Domain/Decision/Policies/*; app/Domain/Cognition/NativeAffectEngine.php; app/Domain/Decision/UtilityScorer.php','A miner can raid (preference 0.15), turtle 0.08, raider 1.00, fleeter 0.85, hybrid 0.55, modulated by activity/aggression/skill/profit. allows() should represent game legality; persona becomes a strong negative preference. Vengeance = 0.15 + 0.85*aggression + small archetype bias (Fleeter +0.15, Raider +0.10, Turtle +0.05, Hybrid +0.05, Miner 0). Keep existing forbids during migration, marked technical debt. | FROZEN 1 Oct 2026 (direction reset, AGENTS.md): no work until the six aspects of play move live on the cohorts. Unfreeze by setting status back to todo.','2026-10-01 10:03:35'),
 (211,'PERS-011','Deferred: Expeditioner archetype + ActiveTrader strategic significance + patience trait','deferred','deferred','P3',NULL,NULL,NULL,'specs/persona-decomposition.md',NULL,'A personality label that cannot affect behaviour is worse than none. Expeditioner joins only when expedition behaviour lands (WP-009 composes/dispatches, nothing makes expeditions a growth loop yet). ActiveTrader stays an identity field until a real trade planner exists. patience joins only when a system needs it.','2026-09-24 12:47:32'),
 (212,'PIPE-001','Strategy context bundle builder (deterministic)','impl','in_progress','P1',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'app/Actions/BuildStrategyContextBundleAction.php','Turn one corpus source (raw/<family>/<site>/<topic>/<id>.md) into a model-ready bundle: page facts, link dependency tree, pre-extracted number table, host object check, existing-implementation map (principles/code/GAP/tasks), scenario hooks. Deterministic; no model call; no new provider client, no new window or rate config - reuse AiClock, ai.routing windows and ai.pricing.','2026-09-28 19:50:10'),
 (213,'PIPE-002','Strategy plan proposal validator (deterministic)','impl','deferred','P2',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'app/Actions/ValidateStrategyPlanProposalAction.php','Refuse a plan whose file/doc/principle refs do not resolve, which names an object absent from the bundle''s host list, which proposes an abstraction where a principle already covers the concept, which adds a per-account constant (gate 1), which names no acceptance signal, or which does not name a single doctrine variant. Fail closed: an unvalidated proposal may never become a task row. | FROZEN 1 Oct 2026 (direction reset, AGENTS.md): no work until the six aspects of play move live on the cohorts. Unfreeze by setting status back to todo.','2026-10-01 10:03:35'),
 (214,'PIPE-003','ai:pipeline-plan runner reusing routing, pricing and the laravel/ai SDK','impl','deferred','P1',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'app/Console/Commands/PlanStrategy.php','Add a strategy_plan rung to ai.routing ladders (config diff, not a new client), an OgameStrategyPlanAgent in app/Ai/Agents, and a command that parses the off-peak window from ai.routing rather than a second copy: inside peak it parks and exits cleanly, outside it resolves the route via ResolveAiProviderRouteAction, calls the agent, validates via PIPE-002 and writes an unapproved proposal to storage/ai-pipeline/proposals. | FROZEN 1 Oct 2026 (direction reset, AGENTS.md): no work until the six aspects of play move live on the cohorts. Unfreeze by setting status back to todo.','2026-10-01 10:03:35'),
 (215,'PIPE-004','Doctrine registry and adoption (defence/attack/expansion/economy)','impl','deferred','P2',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'app/Ai/Doctrine/DoctrineRegistry.php','Named doctrine variants sourced from the corpus, adopted per persona and environment, stored on the profile so it is observable. Gate 3: every variant is a style a player can be named doing. Gate 1: variants express taste, never reachability. | FROZEN 1 Oct 2026 (direction reset, AGENTS.md): no work until the six aspects of play move live on the cohorts. Unfreeze by setting status back to todo.','2026-10-01 10:03:35'),
 (216,'PIPE-005','Cohort horizon expectations (sleep, wake, assert the adopted doctrine)','impl','deferred','P2',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'app/Actions/AssertDoctrineExpectationAction.php','An expectation declares a horizon plus a predicate derived from the adopted variant (e.g. by T+6h the wall composition is within tolerance of the doctrine ratio, and a fodder-only persona shows no big-gun ratios). The scheduler sleeps until the horizon instead of polling; waiting costs no tokens. Reuse resources/scenarios and ai:replay-scenario. | FROZEN 1 Oct 2026 (direction reset, AGENTS.md): no work until the six aspects of play move live on the cohorts. Unfreeze by setting status back to todo.','2026-10-01 10:03:35'),
