 (345,'QUAL-003','Defence never reaches every planet: naked planets beside a walled one','impl','todo','P1','NAKED_BESIDE_WALLED',NULL,NULL,NULL,'app/Domain/Decision/QueueableUnitPlanner.php','The cohort read found accounts with a planet at zero defence while a sibling holds a real wall, so the wall is being built in one place instead of everywhere it is wanted. Raised from the cohort read''s own verdict. Invariant name NAKED_BESIDE_WALLED is the dedupe key: do not raise a second task while this one is open.
Evidence:
